# Extra Debian packages `glovebox create` installs in every new VM on first
# boot (apt-get, before --provision). Optional: copy this file to
# glovebox-packages.txt (next to the config) and edit it, or pass another
# file with `create --packages FILE`. Without one, nothing extra is installed.
#
# One package per line, or several on a line separated by spaces; # starts a
# comment. On a proxy-only VM apt goes through Squid, so its mirror
# (deb.debian.org) must be open in /etc/squid/provision_domains.txt.

git
tmux vim
build-essential python3-venv
